Package: bigcurve
Title: Adaptive Densifying of Lines
Version: 0.5.0.9000
Authors@R:
    c(person("Michael D.", "Sumner", , "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Simon", "Wotherspoon", role = "ctb",  comment = "wrote SGAT::trackMdpts, the ancestor of the spherical midpoint used here"))
Description: Densify lines adaptively, as required by the curvature a map
    projection imposes on them. Vertices are inserted along great circle
    arcs only where the projected curve deviates from a straight chord by
    more than a tolerance, following the adaptive resampling scheme of
    'd3-geo' by Mike Bostock.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
